abstract: >-
  Prithvi-EO-2.0 is a geospatial foundation model that is
  trained on millions of global time series samples from
  NASA's Harmonized Landsat and Sentinel-2 data archive. In
  this project we explored the potential use and performance
  of Prithvi-EO-2.0 for UK crop classification.
